## 4. Attribution

Attribution is **not required**, but it is always appreciated.

- If you redistribute the original software or a substantial portion of it, keeping this license and the original copyright notice is recommended.
- If you remove the author's name from your modified version, that's fine.
- If you keep the author's name, that's also fine.
- If you write "based on T-Spine Code (TSC) by Subhrajit Sain", that's cool too.

No mandatory "I LOVE THE AUTHOR" badge is required.
But you can't write that T-Spine Code (TSC) was made by you according to Section 2 due to Copyright.

